# SandboxVars — every sandbox setting, with the game's own default.
#
# Defaults are extracted from the game's own Apocalypse preset,
# media/lua/shared/Sandbox/Apocalypse.lua, which is what the server means by
# "default". The enum labels come from the comments the server writes into a
# generated servertest_SandboxVars.lua, where each graded setting documents
# its own numbering.
#
# Format: key<TAB>type<TAB>default<TAB>option;option;... (options optional)
# Keys are dotted where the Lua table nests.
